   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 01 - Parallel VLM Inference to Database\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Build dataset with `samples_per_config` samples from each Cauldron split, each with all 5 model responses.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Skip Logic:**\n",
    "- If a split already has >= `samples_per_config` COMPLETE samples (all 5 models), skip it entirely\n",
    "- Otherwise, process only samples missing responses\n",
    "\n",
    "**Parallelization:**\n",
    "1. Config-level: Multiple splits in parallel\n",
    "2. Sample-level: Multiple samples per split in parallel\n",
    "3. Model-level: All 5 VLMs called simultaneously per sample"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
